{"id":"49f228132d91","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff","lang":"en","title":"USI Administrative Staff","description":"Administrative staff are entitled to financial support to participate in continuing education opportunities abroad. The Swiss-European Mobility Programme (SEMP) allows participation in training courses at a European institution or company, regardless of whether it is a USI…","section":"Relint","crumbs":["Relint","Specific information for:"],"image":null,"words":255,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint/informazioni-specifiche/personale-amministrativo","en":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Relint","path":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Specific information for:","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"USI Administrative Staff","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Administrative staff are entitled to financial support to participate in continuing education opportunities abroad.<br> The Swiss-European Mobility Programme (SEMP) allows participation in training courses at a European institution or company, regardless of whether it is a USI partner.</p> <p>If you are interested, please contact the International Relations Service (<a href=\"mailto:relint@usi.ch\">relint@usi.ch</a>) and confirm with your supervisor whether the activity is permitted and recognized.</p> <p>All detailed information is available on the <strong>Movetia</strong> website and accessible <a href=\"https://movetia.ch/en/funding-opportunities/stays-abroad-for-staff-in-higher-education/training-activities-abroad-for-staff-in-higher-education\">here</a>.</p> <p><strong>Conditions</strong><br> Eligible mobility formats include training courses, workshops, or job shadowing. Participation in conferences is <strong>not</strong> admissible.<br> Funding <strong>cannot</strong> be granted for scientific activities, but only for teaching or administrative mobilities that contribute to internationalization.</p> <p><strong>Duration</strong><br> The stay must last <strong>at least two days on-site</strong> and a <strong>maximum of seven days</strong>, including travel time.</p> <p><strong>Destinations</strong><br> Participants are responsible for organizing their stay abroad independently. They are free to choose the host organization (a university or, in exceptional cases, a company or another organization).</p> <p><strong>Grants</strong><br> Subject to the funds allocated to USI by the <strong>Movetia National Agency</strong>, eligible costs include travel, accommodation, and meals.<br> Grants for stays can be consulted on <a href=\"https://movetia.ch/en/funding-opportunities/stays-abroad-for-staff-in-higher-education/training-activities-abroad-for-staff-in-higher-education\">this page</a>.<br> Scholarships are <strong>limited</strong> and usually assigned on a <strong>first-come, first-served basis</strong>.</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Staff week"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>A great search engine to find Staff Weeks organized by other universities is:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"http://staffmobility.eu/staff-Week-search\">http://staffmobility.eu/staff-Week-search</a></li> </ul> <p>Below is the list of Staff Weeks organized by USI partner universities, sorted by registration deadline. </p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>Name</strong></td> <td><strong>Place</strong></td> <td><strong>Date</strong></td> <td><strong>Deadline</strong></td> <td><strong>Additional information</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>International Staff Week </td> <td>Université Sorbonne Nouvelle, Paris</td> <td>15-19 February 2027</td> <td>23 October 2026</td> <td><a href=\"https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fstaffmobility.eu%2Fstaffweek%2Fenhancing-internationalization-sorbonne%3Futm_source%3Dchatgpt.com&amp;data=05%7C02%7Crelint%40usi.ch%7C809654d31c3c4d53019008df18933c9d%7C95bdc5acafb54881801b3874f365cd6f%7C0%7C0%7C639256693251116360%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C60000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=re0Zypt2lQAue%2F9xGFDv5jC5Hs%2By0FAMCOtOCStMGv4%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Link</a></td> </tr> </tbody> </table>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad","href":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Governance","href":"/en/universita/info/relint/governance"},{"label":"Strategy and objectives 2025-2028","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/internationalization-strategy-goals"},{"label":"International relations commission","href":"/en/university/info/relint/commission"},{"label":"International collaborations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/partnerships"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/relint/annual-report"},{"label":"Statistical data","href":"/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures"},{"label":"All categories","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"USI students","href":"/en/university/info/relint/usi-student"},{"label":"Incoming exchanges","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-exchange-students"},{"label":"Incoming internships","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-mobility-for-internship"},{"label":"InclUSIone","href":"/en/university/info/relint/inclusione"},{"label":"ESKAS scholarship holders","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/swiss-government-excellence-scholarships"},{"label":"Scholars at Risk","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/scholars-at-risk-network"},{"label":"USI academic staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/academic-staff"},{"label":"USI staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff"},{"label":"Incoming academic body","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-academic-staff"},{"label":"Incoming staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-staff-mobilities"},{"label":"Visiting researchers","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers"},{"label":"External organisations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations"},{"label":"Partner universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universita-partner"},{"label":"Interested universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested"},{"label":"Internationalisation at home - I@H","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/internationalization-at-home"},{"label":"\"Come and Go\" newsletter","href":"/en/university/info/relint/come-go-archive"},{"label":"Events","href":"/en/university/info/relint/events"},{"label":"Il mondo in USI","href":"/en/university/info/relint/il-mondo-in-usi"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/university/info/relint/news"},{"label":"Team and contacts","href":"/en/university/info/relint/team"},{"label":"2005-2025: 20 years of activity","href":"/en/university/info/relint/20-years-of-activity"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:57:22.960Z"}